#: ui.py:1196
msgid "(Creases, Cuts and Holes)"
msgstr "（折痕、切口与孔洞）"

#: props.py:2245
msgid "(old) Frames to open"
msgstr "（旧）要展开的框架"

#: ops.py:1427
msgid "(older: the same as On)"
msgstr "（更旧：与“开”相同）"

#: props.py:133
msgid "(pick a tube)"
msgstr "（选择一个管状结构）"

#: props.py:2183
msgid "0: the join tab is set so the floor's valley runs level into the stage when it is fully open. More dips the valley's front (tipping it up past level would tear)"
msgstr "0：连接片设置成完全打开时，地板的谷线平齐接入舞台。数值越大，谷线前端越向下倾（向上翘过水平会撕裂）"

#: props.py:2163
msgid "0: the join tab is set so the roof's ridge runs level into the stage when it is fully open. More lifts the ridge's front (tipping it down past level would tear)"
msgstr "0：连接片设置成完全打开时，屋顶的屋脊平齐接入舞台。数值越大，屋脊前端抬得越高（向下倾过水平会撕裂）"

#: props.py:1177
msgid "45° Fold Size"
msgstr "45° 折尺寸"

#: props.py:1071
msgid "45° Folds"
msgstr "45° 折"

#: props.py:1409
msgid "45° Triangles"
msgstr "45° 三角形"

#: props.py:1073
msgid "45° folds at both ends of each leg"
msgstr "每条支腿两端的 45° 折"

#: ui.py:1289
msgid ":"
msgstr "："

#: core/tethers.py:158
#: core/tethers.py:160
msgid "A"
msgstr "A"

#: props.py:1072
msgid "A 45° fold in each leg's outer corner, at the front end"
msgstr "每条支腿前端外侧角上的 45° 折"

#: props.py:1165
msgid "A 45° fold onto each page"
msgstr "折向每页的 45° 折"

#: props.py:1578
msgid "A V-fold on the card's spine whose glue lines fall away from it (Glue Angle over 90) as a roof or ceiling: cut the background away above its glue lines, so only the V-fold shows above them"
msgstr "卡片中缝上的 V 形折，其粘接线向外倾斜（粘接角度大于 90），用作屋顶或天花板：切掉其粘接线以上的背景，使其上方只露出 V 形折"

#: props.py:105
msgid "A back zig-zag on angled sticking strips with a front strip across the spine, joined each side by a side piece into a quadrilateral that folds flat (Birmingham 57)"
msgstr "在倾斜粘接条上的背面之字形结构，前面有一条横跨中缝的条，两侧各由一块侧片连接成可折平的四边形（Birmingham 57）"

#: props.py:108
msgid "A box glued to one page, one wall rising from the fold, pulled up by a 45° fold from the other page; pairs of 45° folds fill in its ends (Birmingham 82)"
msgstr "粘在一页上的盒子，一面壁从折痕升起，由另一页的 45° 折拉起；两端由成对的 45° 折补合（Birmingham 82）"

#: scene_setup.py:475
msgid "A camera past the bottom end of the spine, above it, framing the whole card as it opens"
msgstr "位于中缝底端之外、其上方的摄像机，在卡片打开时取景整张卡片"

#: props.py:717
msgid "A crease whose far side (towards the centre fold) is a glue tab: it is glued back to back with its mirror image, joining two parts cut apart at the centre (a peaked roof from the card)"
msgstr "一条折痕，其远端（朝向中心折痕）是粘接片：它与镜像背对背粘接，把从中心切开的两个部分连接起来（卡片形成的尖顶屋顶）"

#: ops.py:2057
msgid "A cut starting and ending on the centre fold, on one half only: the shape juts out flat past the fold (Birmingham 6)"
msgstr "仅在一半上、从中心折痕起止的切口：形状平着伸出折痕之外（Birmingham 6）"

#: props.py:94
msgid "A figure on two pairs of 45° folds cut into a V-fold's crease, the V-fold its body: the chest leans back into the V as the card closes, the arms swing forward round it and the head rises (Birmingham 79)"
msgstr "切入 V 形折折痕的两对 45° 折上的图形，V 形折为其身体：卡片合上时胸部后仰进入 V 形折，手臂绕其向前摆，头抬起（Birmingham 79）"

#: scene_setup.py:469
msgid "A fine paper grain (a bump only; colours and prints untouched). Edit the 'Pop-up Paper Texture' node group to use your own"
msgstr "细腻的纸张纹理（仅凹凸；颜色和印刷不受影响）。编辑“Pop-up Paper Texture”节点组以使用你自己的纹理"

#: props.py:1337
msgid "A foot glued on the left strip"
msgstr "粘在左侧条上的支脚"

#: props.py:1338
msgid "A foot glued on the right strip"
msgstr "粘在右侧条上的支脚"

#: props.py:871
msgid "A page of the card"
msgstr "卡片的一页"

#: props.py:2229
msgid "A page showing where each part glues on the card, with a parts list"
msgstr "显示各部件在卡片上粘接位置的页面，并附部件列表"

#: props.py:1413
msgid "A pair at each end"
msgstr "两端各一对"

#: props.py:1412
msgid "A pair at the bottom end"
msgstr "底端一对"

#: props.py:1411
msgid "A pair at the top end of the fold between top and front"
msgstr "顶部与前面之间折痕顶端的一对"

#: props.py:82
msgid "A peaked roof: the background is cut to a gable and a V-fold glued along its eaves rises to a ridge, level when the card or stage is fully open"
msgstr "尖顶屋顶：背景切成山墙，沿屋檐粘接的 V 形折升至屋脊，卡片或舞台完全打开时保持水平"

#: props.py:2204
msgid "A photo studio's light (Blender's studio HDRI) and the sun's shadows, 64 render samples: real reflections, so metallic and glossy parts shine"
msgstr "摄影棚灯光（Blender 的 studio HDRI）和太阳阴影，64 次渲染采样：真实反射，让金属和光泽部件闪耀"

#: scene_setup.py:215
msgid "A photo studio's light (Blender's studio HDRI) with the sun's shadows, at 64 samples: soft, even light with real reflections, so metallic and glossy parts shine"
msgstr "摄影棚灯光（Blender 的 studio HDRI）带太阳阴影，64 次采样：柔和均匀的光线并具有真实反射，让金属和光泽部件闪耀"

#: props.py:80
msgid "A picture held up off the background by a small bridge, or flat on a leg (parallelogram stand-up, Birmingham 38)"
msgstr "由小桥撑离背景的图片，或平贴在支腿上的图片（平行四边形立起结构，Birmingham 38）"

#: props.py:98
msgid "A piece of card glued flat on any face: a box's top or front (a stand-up), a V-fold half, a 45° triangle, a page. It can reach past the face's edges"
msgstr "平粘在任意面上的卡片：盒子的顶部或前面（立起结构）、V 形折的一半、45° 三角形、一页。它可以伸出该面的边缘"

#: props.py:114
msgid "A piece standing square across a rising sheet, slotted into it, held by a 45° fold onto one page or both (Birmingham 81)"
msgstr "垂直横跨一张立起纸片的部件，插入其中，由折到一页或两页上的 45° 折固定（Birmingham 81）"

#: ops.py:2217
msgid "A plain crease to set by numbers"
msgstr "可按数值设置的普通折痕"

#: ops.py:2048
#: ops.py:2065
msgid "A plain line to set by numbers"
msgstr "可按数值设置的普通线"

#: props.py:982
msgid "A pleated fan glued along its two end edges: more paper than the gap it spans (Spread), folding flat pleat on pleat as the card shuts"
msgstr "沿两端边缘粘接的褶皱扇：纸张多于其跨越的间隙（Spread），卡片合上时一褶叠一褶地折平"

#: props.py:1339
msgid "A point on another tube"
msgstr "另一个管状结构上的点"

#: props.py:1479
msgid "A pointed (gothic) arch, curving in to a peak"
msgstr "尖拱（哥特式），向内弯曲至尖顶"

#: ops.py:2068
msgid "A pointed shape cut into the top from the front's top fold: it stands up above the box like a spire"
msgstr "从前面的顶部折痕切入顶部的尖形：它像尖塔一样立在盒子上方"

#: props.py:85
msgid "A raised platform on two legs glued either side of the fold, its top folding in a valley above the fold, propped square by 45° folds (Birmingham 80); it can stand off the centre"
msgstr "由粘在折痕两侧的两条支腿撑起的抬高平台，其顶部在折痕上方形成谷折，由 45° 折垂直支撑（Birmingham 80）；它可以偏离中心"

#: props.py:1477
msgid "A rounded arch"
msgstr "圆拱"

#: props.py:88
msgid "A single sheet rising from the fold, held up half way between the pages by a 45° fold on each face (Birmingham 81)"
msgstr "从折痕升起的一张纸片，由每面上的 45° 折支撑在页面之间的一半高度（Birmingham 81）"

#: ops.py:291
msgid "A stage has a staging frame and up to three frames"
msgstr "一个舞台有一个舞台框架和最多三个框架"

#: props.py:78
msgid "A stage standing in the card as a V-fold, with frames and a ceiling inside it (Birmingham 118)"
msgstr "以 V 形折立在卡片中的舞台，内部有框架和天花板（Birmingham 118）"

#: props.py:1476
msgid "A straight cut from each tab start to the top of the arch"
msgstr "从每个接片起点到拱顶的直线切口"

#: props.py:101
msgid "A strip of walls glued only by its two end walls along sticking strips set at an angle to the spine, every crease square to its bottom edge: the walls between zig-zag forward or back to a centre crease (Birmingham 45-48)"
msgstr "一条墙带，仅由其两端壁沿与中缝成角度的粘接条粘接，每条折痕都垂直于其底边：各壁之间向前或向后之字形折向中心折痕（Birmingham 45-48）"

#: scene_setup.py:458
msgid "A sun lamp from above left: shadows inside the stage show at once which way each fold goes"
msgstr "左上方太阳光：舞台内部的阴影可立即显示每道折痕的方向"

#: ops.py:176
msgid "ASYM: an asymmetric V-fold; VALLEY: a roof upside down; STRAP: a box fold with equal sides (gullies off the centre); ANGLED: a box fold with angled glue lines; CASTLE: a tube with towers; LOOP: a ring on two tabs; TOWERS: a tower in every inside corner of a tube; TOP: a V-fold at the top of a V-fold's crease"
msgstr "ASYM：不对称 V 形折；VALLEY：倒置的屋顶；STRAP：两侧相等的盒形折（沟槽偏离中心）；ANGLED：粘接线成角度的盒形折；CASTLE：带塔的管状结构；LOOP：两个接片上的环；TOWERS：管状结构每个内角中的塔；TOP：V 形折折痕顶端的 V 形折"

#: props.py:722
msgid "Across from the centre fold (mm, left half negative)"
msgstr "距中心折痕的横向距离（mm，左半为负）"

#: props.py:1575
msgid "Across the V-fold's own centre crease, between its halves: the V-fold is its spine"
msgstr "横跨 V 形折自身中心折痕、在其两半之间：V 形折就是它的中缝"

