msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

#: scene_setup.py:485
msgid "All Workspaces"
msgstr "所有工作区"

#: props.py:2116
msgid "All lines in one colour and opacity, e.g. white over dark art or soft black over light art"
msgstr "所有线条使用同一颜色和透明度，例如深色图稿上用白色，浅色图稿上用柔和黑色"

#: props.py:2110
msgid "All lines in one file, creases red so they import as their own colour layer; no artwork"
msgstr "所有线条放在一个文件中，折痕为红色，以便作为独立颜色图层导入；不含图稿"

#: arrange.py:198
msgid "Along"
msgstr "沿"

#: arrange.py:199
#: props.py:2041
msgid "Along Fold"
msgstr "沿折线"

#: props.py:1619
msgid "Along the Crease"
msgstr "沿折痕"

#: arrange.py:232
msgid "Already lined up"
msgstr "已对齐"

#: props.py:1964
msgid "Also cut in every frame behind it and the background, lined up as seen from the front when the stage is fully open"
msgstr "还要在其后的每个框架和背景上切割，并在舞台完全展开时按正面对齐"

#: props.py:1279
msgid "Alternate Out and In"
msgstr "交替向外和向内"

#: ui.py:1399
msgid "An arch has no straight top: hinged on the left"
msgstr "拱门没有平直顶部：左侧铰接"

#: props.py:1104
msgid "An open box, pulled up by its 45° fold"
msgstr "打开的盒子，由其 45° 折痕拉起"

#: props.py:1924
msgid "An opening on one face carries on across its folds onto the faces next to it (a gate through a tower's corner, an arch across a crease), instead of stopping at them. It still stops at the piece's edges"
msgstr "一个面上的开口会越过其折痕延续到相邻面上（穿过塔角的门、跨折痕的拱门），而不是在折痕处停止。它仍会在部件边缘停止"

#: ui.py:1402
msgid "An oval door is cut as a rectangle"
msgstr "椭圆形门按矩形切割"

#: props.py:735
msgid "Angle"
msgstr "角度"

#: props.py:1000
