msgstr "角度 E"

#: ui.py:978
msgid "Angle E (= F)"
msgstr "角度 E（= F）"

#: props.py:1003
msgid "Angle F"
msgstr "角度 F"

#: props.py:1380
msgid "Angle between the piece's centre fold and its left glue edge (degrees). Must be at least the glue angle or the paper tears before the card is flat"
msgstr "部件中心折痕与其左胶边之间的角度（度）。必须至少为胶角，否则卡片展平前纸张会撕裂"

#: props.py:1375
msgid "Angle between the spine and the left glue line (degrees)"
msgstr "书脊与左胶线之间的角度（度）"

#: props.py:735
msgid "Angle from straight up the centre fold, turning towards the left (degrees): 90 runs straight out to the left, over 90 runs down"
msgstr "从中心折痕正上方起向左转的角度（度）：90 直向左伸出，大于 90 向下"

#: props.py:1432
msgid "Angled Glue Lines"
msgstr "倾斜胶线"

#: props.py:1447
msgid "Angled box fold: the angle on the strip between each glue line and the crease next to it (degrees). The glue angle (half of it with three creases) lies flat when open; bigger stands up even open flat. 0: lie flat"
msgstr "斜角盒折：每条胶线与相邻折痕之间条带上的角度（度）。胶角（有三条折痕时为其一半）打开时平放；角度更大时即使完全展开也立起。0：平放"

#: props.py:1076
msgid "Animal Face"
msgstr "动物脸"

#: props.py:1080
msgid "Animal face: its base tabs are ears, glued to the pages out from the loop; how far they reach from the wall's foot"
msgstr "动物脸：其底部翼片是耳朵，粘在环圈外侧的页面上；它们从壁脚伸出多远"

#: props.py:1091
msgid "Animal face: the angle cut out each side of the front crease's line above the wall; its edges stuck together fold the muzzle back over the loop. Wider folds it further, and stops the front opening so far"
msgstr "动物脸：在前折痕线高于壁面的两侧切出的角度；其边缘粘在一起，使口鼻部向后折到环圈上方。角度越宽，折得越远，并限制前部开口程度"

#: props.py:1339
msgid "Another Tube"
msgstr "另一个管"

#: ui.py:1547
msgid "Any Grease Pencil mode and tool: move, erase, draw"
msgstr "任意蜡笔模式与工具：移动、擦除、绘制"

#: props.py:1950
msgid "Arch"
msgstr "拱门"

#: props.py:1468
msgid "Arch Height"
msgstr "拱门高度"

#: props.py:1397
#: props.py:1399
msgid "Arches"
msgstr "拱门"

#: props.py:1150
#: ui.py:935
msgid "Arm Length"
msgstr "臂长"

#: ui.py:907
msgid "Arm Reach"
msgstr "臂伸出长度"

#: props.py:1153
#: ui.py:934
msgid "Arm Width"
msgstr "臂宽"

#: ui.py:858
msgid "Arm Width (0 = auto)"
msgstr "臂宽（0 = 自动）"

#: props.py:111
msgid "Arms jutting out through slots in a V-fold's halves (or a box fold's front), glued to a back piece hanging behind it: they swing as the card opens (Birmingham 65-66)"
msgstr "臂从 V 折两半（或盒折前部）的槽中伸出，粘在后方悬挂的背部件上：卡片打开时它们会摆动（Birmingham 65-66）"

#: props.py:2106
msgid "Art + Cut Lines"
msgstr "图稿 + 切割线"

#: props.py:2138
#: ui.py:1528
msgid "Artwork"
msgstr "图稿"

#: props.py:2106
msgid "Artwork outlined by cut lines only: no fold lines or guides over the art; file name ends _art"
msgstr "仅用切割线勾勒图稿：图稿上无折线或参考线；文件名以 _art 结尾"

#: props.py:2105
msgid "Artwork, tabs, glue guides and all lines"
msgstr "图稿、翼片、涂胶参考线和所有线条"

#: props.py:2229
msgid "Assembly Page"
msgstr "组装页"

#: props.py:1507
msgid "Asymmetric V-fold: length of the right glue edge (mm; 0 = as the left)"
msgstr "不对称 V 折：右胶边长度（毫米；0 = 与左侧相同）"

#: props.py:1364
msgid "Asymmetric V-fold: work out the piece angles from the glue angles and the Lean, so the piece always folds flat in the closed card (left piece angle = right glue angle + Lean, right piece angle = left glue angle + Lean; glue angles over 90 point it backwards and are measured from the other end of the spine). Off: set them yourself"
msgstr "不对称 V 折：根据胶角和倾斜量计算部件角度，使部件在闭合卡片中总能平折（左部件角度 = 右胶角 + 倾斜量，右部件角度 = 左胶角 + 倾斜量；胶角大于 90 时朝后，并从书脊另一端测量）。关闭：自行设置"

#: ui.py:651
msgid "At the top of the lifting piece's crease"
msgstr "在提升部件折痕顶部"

#: props.py:1259
msgid "At the two free corners the floors stop a mm or two apart; as it folds one slides inside the other, its end curling out of the way (Kim's)"
msgstr "在两个自由角处，地板相隔一两毫米停止；折叠时一个滑入另一个内，其端部卷起让开（Kim's）"

