#: props.py:963
msgid "Birmingham 13-14: a wedge cut out of the far end of the centre crease, its edges stuck together by a tab, sculpts the V-fold's end into a beak. Each side's end is a facet creased off its half, from the bite's point to the half's far corner"
msgstr "Birmingham 13-14：从中心折痕远端切出一个楔形，其边缘由粘片粘合，将 V 形折的端部塑造成喙。每侧的端部都是从其半边上折出的面片，从咬口尖端到该半边的远端角。"

#: props.py:1482
msgid "Birmingham 21-22: stuck on top of the V-fold it stands on. That one's top is cut to a point along the glue lines and its own tabs (A) stick under this piece"
msgstr "Birmingham 21-22：粘在其所立 V 形折的顶部。该折的顶部沿粘合线切成尖点，其自身的粘片 (A) 粘在此件下方。"

#: props.py:987
msgid "Birmingham 28-29: the V-fold's halves go on past a crease (H) into an outer panel each side. Only the outer panels are glued down; the halves between them ride up on their creases. The centre crease takes other mechanisms like any V-fold's"
msgstr "Birmingham 28-29：V 形折的两个半边越过折痕 (H) 延伸为每侧的外面板。只粘合外面板；它们之间的半边沿其折痕升起。中心折痕像任何 V 形折一样承载其他结构。"

#: props.py:984
msgid "Birmingham 45-48: square creases instead of a V. The glue lines' walls stand up off the page and faces zig-zag in to a centre crease: one face each side juts like a V, more make a concertina"
msgstr "Birmingham 45-48：用方形折痕代替 V 形。粘合线的壁从纸面立起，面片呈之字形通向中心折痕：每侧一个面像 V 形一样突出，更多面则形成手风琴折。"

