msgid "Box fold or strap: creases along the strip so it zig-zags into this many peaks as the card closes (still glued only at its ends). Each valley between two peaks opens like a small spine and can carry a pop-up (Fold: Valley)"
msgstr "盒式折或条带：沿条带设置折痕，使其在卡片闭合时呈之字形形成此数量的峰（仍只粘合两端）。两个峰之间的每个谷像小书脊一样打开，并可承载弹出结构（折型：谷折）"

