msgid "Box fold or strap: run the strip across the fold at an angle (degrees from square). Its creases stay parallel to the fold; one end sits further up the card than the other, so what stands on its folds is offset diagonally"
msgstr "盒式折或条带：让条带以一定角度（相对直角的度数）横跨折痕。其折痕保持平行于折痕；一端比另一端更靠卡片上方，因此立在其折痕上的结构会沿对角线偏移"

